# VST / JUCE code style

Applies to `vst/**` only (not logue `src/oscillators/`).

## Architecture

- **Processor** — audio, MIDI, parameters, state save/load.
- **Editor** — UI only; never run DSP in the editor.
- **Dsp/** (optional) — pure DSP classes with no JUCE UI includes.

## Realtime rules

- No `new`/`delete`, locks, file I/O, or logging in `processBlock`.
- Preallocate voices/buffers in `prepareToPlay`.
- Use `juce::ScopedNoDenormals` at the start of `processBlock`.

## Parameters

- Register all automatable params in `AudioProcessorValueTreeState`.
- Use `SliderAttachment` / `ButtonAttachment` in the editor.

## Naming

- Processor: `<PluginName>AudioProcessor`
- Editor: `<PluginName>AudioProcessorEditor`
- Match class names to CMake `juce_add_plugin` target name.
